# ubturbo-ucache: lintian overrides
#
# The following lintian tags are emitted by design because the Debian
# packaging mirrors the upstream RPM spec (ubturbo.spec). They are reviewed
# and considered acceptable.

# The upstream RPM spec installs everything under /opt/ubturbo/. This path is
# hardcoded in the daemon and plugin loading logic. Migrating to FHS standard
# paths would require coordinated changes across the entire upstream codebase.
ubturbo-ucache: dir-or-file-in-opt

# The upstream RPM spec sets %global __strip /bin/true to preserve debug
# symbols. Stripping is disabled in debian/rules (override_dh_strip) to
# match this behavior.
ubturbo-ucache: unstripped-binary-or-object
